SUMMARY:Profusion Expo - WTPG booth
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Photography Group\nProFusion 2026\, Canada’s lar
 gest Photo\, Video & Cinema Industry Event Welcome all current and future 
 creators and industry trailblazers! Save the date because ProFusion Expo 2
 026 is about to take over the Metro Toronto Convention Centre on November 
 11th and 12th!\n\n## Time & Location\n\nNov 11\, 2026\, 11:00 AM – Nov 1
 2\, 2026\, 3:10 PM\nToronto\, 255 Front St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2W6\, Cana
 da\n\n## About the event\n\nWest Toronto Photography Group is proud to ann
 ounce we will be at ProFusion 2026\, Canada’s largest Photo\, Video & Ci
 nema Industry Event. We are starting this rsvp list so we can send out inf
 ormation and timing for out booth workshops and contests at the event.\nTo
  get tickets to ProFusion 2026 follow this link go to [http://www.profusio
 nexpo.com](http://www.profusionexpo.com/) to check out the event website!\
 n\nWelcome all current and future creators and industry trailblazers! Save
  the date because ProFusion Expo 2026 is about to take over the Metro Toro
 nto Convention Centre on November 11th and 12th!ProFusion 2026 is not just
  another expo—it's THE place to be for two days\; jampacked with the lat
 est gear\, engaging seminars and all things you need to succeed in this fa
 st-paced world of professional imaging. Whether you're a seasoned vlogger\
 , a tech-savvy content creator\, or an industry pro itching to dive into t
 he latest gear\, ProFusion is where we all come together\, so lock in thos
 e dates and gear up for an epic experience. Join us for Canada's ultimate 
 gathering of imaging pros and up-and-coming enthusiasts. It's all about sh
 aring our passion for imaging and getting hands-on with the gear that brin
 gs our vision to life.After more than a decade of incredible success\, we 
 intend to make this the best one yet. Don't miss out on joining us at ProF
 usion Expo 2025 !ProFusion Expo 2026 Dates and HoursWednesday\, November 1
 1\, 2025 – 11:00 a.m. – 7:00 p.m. EST Thursday\, November 12\, 2025 
 – 10:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m. ESTMetro Toronto Convention Centre\, 255 Fron
 t Street West – Hall B – North BuildingVisit [http://www.profusionexpo
 .com](http://www.profusionexpo.com/) for full show details or follow us on
  social for updates as we get closer to the show.Please note: this is a ca
 shless event.
